  "description": "<p>Rev up your living space with this personalized racing area rug, featuring a vibrant checkered flag pattern and a detailed race track design. It allows for a custom name, adding a unique touch for racing enthusiasts. Crafted for both comfort and stability, this rug is an ideal statement piece for any game room, garage, or child's bedroom.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features iconic checkered flag and race-track graphics for an exciting motorsports design.</li>\n<li>Allows for personalization with a custom name or word.</li>\n<li>Soft yet durable polyester surface with non-slip rubber backing for safety and comfort.</li>\n<li>Versatile for game rooms, patios, entries, or living spaces.</li>\n<li>Ideal gift for racing fans, kids, dads, gamers, or auto enthusiasts.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form Type</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Checkered</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style Name</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Text Inputs</td>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Sponge - Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Back Material Type</td>\n<td>High-quality Epoxy</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This racing area rug is perfect for transforming game rooms, garages, or kid's spaces into an exciting motorsport-themed environment. Its versatile design also makes it suitable for patios, entryways, or living spaces, adding a bold statement wherever it's placed.</p>",
